#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {name}"
msgstr "Instaliraj {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {title}"
msgstr "Instaliraj {title}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"A .deb file can't go on the system. For everything to work, look for {title} as an .rpm file or in Bazaar, the app store.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a box anyway, without those parts."
msgstr ""
"Instaliraj {title}\n"
"\n"
"U kutiji ovi delovi aplikacije {title} neće raditi:\n"
"{notes}\n"
".deb datoteka ne može da ide u sistem. Da bi sve radilo, potražite {title} kao .rpm datoteku ili u Bazaar-u, prodavnici aplikacija.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: ipak je stavlja u kutiju, bez tih delova."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"It comes from {maker}'s own download source, which is added to the system so {title} keeps updating. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"To connect, you need a {maker} account."
msgstr ""
"Instaliraj {title}\n"
"\n"
"Dolazi sa sopstvenog izvora za preuzimanje kompanije {maker}, koji se dodaje u sistem kako bi se {title} i dalje ažurirao. Potrebna je vaša lozinka i ponovno pokretanje.\n"
"\n"
"Da biste se povezali, potreban vam je {maker} nalog."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Add to the system. In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"On the system, everything works. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or {setup}: puts it in a separate box. It's easier to remove, but those parts won't work."
msgstr ""
"Instaliraj {title}\n"
"\n"
"Preporučeno: „Dodaj u sistem“. U kutiji ovi delovi aplikacije {title} neće raditi:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"U sistemu sve radi. Potrebni su vaša lozinka i ponovno pokretanje.\n"
"\n"
"Ili {setup}: stavlja je u zasebnu kutiju. Lakše se uklanja, ali ti delovi neće raditi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a separate box. Your system isn't changed, and Remove Apps takes it out cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Instaliraj {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: stavlja je u zasebnu kutiju. Vaš sistem se ne menja, a „Ukloni aplikacije“ je čisto uklanja."

