"On a Public place it asks first, because strangers could reach it too. The "
"bin next to it closes it again."
msgstr ""
"Na javnom mestu prvo pita, jer bi i nepoznati mogli da dopru do njega. Kanta "
"pored njega ga ponovo zatvara."

msgid ""
"On a Windows PC: File Explorer, Network. The Windows PC's own network must be"
