"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Under Also let in, on Home, there are two "
"switches."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite Wheelhouse, „Bezbednost mreže“. U odeljku „Propusti i na mestu "
"‚Kuća‘“ nalaze se dva prekidača."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Under Apps and ports let in, pick the place."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite Wheelhouse, „Bezbednost mreže“. U odeljku „Propuštene aplikacije i "
"portovi“ izaberite mesto."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Your networks lists every network this "
"computer has joined."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite Wheelhouse, „Bezbednost mreže“. „Vaše mreže“ navodi svaku mrežu na "
"koju se ovaj računar povezivao."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Shared folders."
msgstr "Otvorite Wheelhouse, „Deljene fascikle“."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Updates, Automatic updates. On is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite Wheelhouse, Ažuriranja, „Automatska ažuriranja“. Preporučuje se "
"uključeno."

msgid ""
"Open Wi-Fi, with no password, is always a Public place, because anyone can "
"make one with the same name."
msgstr ""
"Otvorena Wi-Fi mreža, bez lozinke, uvek je „Javno mesto“, jer svako može da "
"napravi mrežu sa istim imenom."

msgid "Open a port"
msgstr "Otvori port"

