msgstr "Ponovo ga izaberite u „Nabavi VPN“."

msgid "Pick one."
msgstr "Izaberite jedno."

msgid "Pick the app for the web, mail, calendar, music, videos and photos."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite aplikaciju za veb, poštu, kalendar, muziku, video-snimke i "
"fotografije."

msgid ""
"Pick the app. To use it every time for that kind of file, turn on Always use "
"for this file type first."
msgstr ""
